[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:81. Roast Beef and Potatoes]
[00:00.360]Lesson 81 | 第81课
[00:02.830]Hello, Peggy. Where's Tom? | 喂，佩吉。汤姆在哪里？
[00:06.450]He's upstairs. | 他在楼上。
[00:08.035]He's having a bath. | 他正在洗澡。
[00:09.980]Tom! | 汤姆！
[00:11.625]Yes? | 怎么了？
[00:12.800]John's here. | 约翰来了。
[00:14.630]I'm nearly ready. | 我快准备好了。
[00:17.450]Hello, John. | 喂，约翰。
[00:20.115]Have a cigarette. | 来根烟。
[00:21.435]No, thanks, Tom. | 不用了，谢谢，汤姆。
[00:22.560]Have a glass of whisky then. | 那就来杯威士忌吧。
[00:24.000]Okay, thanks. | 好的，谢谢。
[00:26.020]Is dinner ready, Peggy? | 佩吉，晚饭准备好了吗？
[00:27.745]It's nearly ready. | 快好了。
[00:29.200]We can have dinner at 7 o'clock. | 我们七点可以吃晚饭。
[00:32.090]John and I had lunch together today. | 约翰和我今天一起吃的午饭。
[00:34.920]We went to a restaurant. | 我们去了一家餐馆。
[00:36.790]What did you have? | 你们吃了什么？
[00:38.530]We had roast beef and potatoes. | 我们吃了烤牛肉和土豆。
[00:41.230]Oh. | 哦。
[00:42.700]What's the matter, Peggy? | 怎么了，佩吉？
[00:44.505]Well, you're going to have roast beef and potatoes again tonight. | 嗯，你们今晚又要吃烤牛肉和土豆了。